        "created_at": "2017-08-22T15:47:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi there, I preordered FotEG from this website at PAX East after play testing it. &nbsp;Later I found the finished kickstarted and through there, ordered Beasts from Beyond. &nbsp; I received the expansion last week, but I havent heard anything about the base game being shipped or anything at all really from the Greater than Games store. &nbsp; I'm seriously jonesing to get at this game so any info people may have would help. &nbsp; Has anyone else received the game after preordering it from this website?</p>",
